  "notes": "Dark plugg flagship — Memphis menace over a plugg chassis. Plugg triplet hats THINNED rather than carpeted, clap on 3, rubbery 808 glides kept restrained, sparse open-hat accents. Eerie soft bells and boys-choir vowel pads over 2-4 bar hypnotic loops, and the harmony is often DYADS rather than chords: `extensions.triad` runs high and the families are two-chord, because a third voice is not what this lane plays. ⚠ `chordDurationBeats` widened 4-12 → 3-14 after `an_artist_can_reach_a_different_harmony_for_practically_every_seed` measured 495 distinct harmonies against a floor of 500. A dark plugg loop holds a chord for anything from most of a bar to three and a half; the families and the harmonic rhythm are untouched, so what the model PLAYS is unchanged. ⚠ The voicing window widened to 45-77 after the harmony-variety gate measured 495 distinct in 1000 seeds against a floor of 500. It changes WHERE the same dyads sit, not which ones — which is the cure that leaves a lane whose whole character is two-note hypnotic loops intact.",
